 packages/ai/src/api/anthropic-claude-code.ts  | 175 ++++--------------
 packages/ai/test/anthropic-auth-token.test.ts |   4 +-
 .../ai/test/anthropic-claude-code.test.ts     |  67 +++----
 3 files changed, 65 insertions(+), 181 deletions(-)

